    "preamble": "Dannarapu Madhavarao vs The State Of Telangana on 18 January, 2021 Author: K. Lakshman Bench: K. Lakshman The Honourable Sri Justice K. Lakshman",
    "facts": "The petitioner is accused in the above said CC. The offences alleged against the petitioner are under Sections 270 and 273 of IPC.",
